  "description": "Aether by French Avenue bursts open with crisp top notes of green apple, bergamot, and mandarin orange, delivering a bright and effervescent first impression. The heart reveals woody and green elements — cedar, petitgrain, and cashmeran — bringing depth and sophistication. In the dry-down, oakmoss, musk, and amberwood settle in, creating a smooth, earthy base that balances the fresh opening with maturity. Overall, this is a fresh, green-fruity woody fragrance with good versatility and a modern character — often compared to higher-priced niche scents.",
